codex
I’m treating `DUPLICATE_OF_ACCOUNTED` narrowly as records from DAPA-HF or EMPEROR-Reduced, because those exact trials are already in the served primary pool. NCT-only rows are getting the registry-only verdict requested by the prompt, with the quote built from the snapshot’s registry fields rather than from an abstract.
